Z||000007||WKDFIRO||02-09-2001||03:12 PM||||A friend of mine and I were in a muffler shop and we were asking for some muffler bearings trying to be the clowns that we are...they guy smiled and went into the back and came out with a dealer box that said muffler bearings. <P>FACTORY BOX SAYING MUFFLER BEARINGS!!!!<P>Apparently certain Mazdas have attachments for the exhuast that are called muffler bearings!<P>The guy laughed and said he never used it but found it and got it from the dealer waiting for someone to make that same joke.<P>We all had a good laugh.||||reg||11
