Z||000010||TheFiero64||02-10-2001||05:19 PM||||Also, You all must oil your brake shoes and rotors to stop them from squealing. I've also heard that using a little glue in the master cylinder will give you a firmer brake feel. I will go try it and let you know  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||12
